  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<i>Booting up Assistant…</i><p></p>\n<p><i>Loading Eliot…</i></p>\n<p>O-oh! Hi there!</p>\n<p>Heheh, it’s been a while since I’ve met another kid! I’m Eliot, your Giggleland guide. Welcome to the place where smiles are forever!</p>\n<p>This is Tolie. She doesn’t talk, but she knows how to listen, and that makes her the best kind of friend. Her dad is waiting for her somewhere in the park, so first we’re going to see Farmer Terry. He loves helping children find their way home!</p>\n<p>There are only a few rules. Stay on the path. Stay where I can see you. And if a door says Staff Only, don’t go in there. It’s against the rules. You’ll get in trouble!</p>\n<p><i>Attention, guests. If you have seen a little girl wearing a white dress and a pink hat, please notify the nearest staff member immediately.</i></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Explore all of Giggleland across eight chapters, from Farmer Terry’s farm to the tunnels beneath the park.\n</li><li>About six hours of first-person psychological horror, in one complete game.\n</li><li>Uncover a story of family, belonging and the true cost of endless happiness, told by a fully voice-acted cast.\n</li><li>Giggleland does things no other horror game has done, and some of them happen outside the game. The full game is safe to stream<b>*</b>.\n</li></ul>\n",
